<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MIXED AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MIXED AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates were</p>
<p>mixed at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Thursday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate was unchanged at 3.09 percent.</p>
<p>				  November 14 fix November 13 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		   3.01 pct		3.00 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		   3.04 pct		3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		   3.09 pct		3.09 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		   3.21 pct		3.21 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		   3.33 pct		3.34 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		  3.46 pct		3.48 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
